			<zone xml:id="p2z4-0" points="1560,1581 1603,1571 1629,1585 1721,1553 1754,1568 1823,1537 1903,1537 1910,1471 1783,1488 1711,1524 1650,1484 1566,1501">1570,1561 1596,1558 1622,1556 1648,1554 1674,1551 1700,1548 1726,1546 1753,1545 1779,1542 1805,1537 1831,1533 1857,1532 1883,1531 1910,1531</zone>
